### Click "Send Request" above each block (VS Code REST Client / Rider / Visual Studio)
@HrApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5206

### List (filter + paging)
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees?department=mobile&page=1&pageSize=10

### Search by name
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees?search=a&pageSize=2

### Get one
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1

### Not found -> 404
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/999

### Route constraint: "abc" is not an int -> 404
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/abc

### Create -> 201 + Location header
POST {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mona", "email": "mona@corp.com", "department": "Design", "salary": 14000 }

### Create invalid -> automatic 400 (validation)
POST {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "M", "email": "not-an-email", "department": "", "salary": 5 }

### Duplicate email -> 409
POST {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ali Two", "email": "ali@corp.com", "department": "Mobile", "salary": 9000 }

### Update
PUT {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sara Ahmed", "department": "HR", "salary": 13000 }

### Promote (custom action)
POST {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/1/promote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "raisePercent": 10, "newDepartment": "Team Lead" }

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/3

### Binding sources
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/whoami?lang=ar
X-Client-Version: 2.4.1

### Unhandled exception -> 500 ProblemDetails
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/employees/boom

### OpenAPI document
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### ================= MINIMAL API (same endpoints, /api/minimal/...) =================

### Ping (one-line endpoint)
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/ping

### List
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/employees?department=mobile&pageSize=1

### Bad paging -> 400
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/employees?page=0

### Get one
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/employees/1

### Create -> 201
POST {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mona", "email": "mona@corp.com", "department": "Design", "salary": 14000 }

### Create invalid -> 400 (AddValidation)
POST {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "M", "email": "not-an-email", "department": "", "salary": 5 }

### Update
PUT {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/employees/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sara Ahmed", "department": "HR", "salary": 13000 }

### Promote
POST {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/employees/1/promote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "raisePercent": 10 }

### Delete -> 204
DELETE {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/employees/3

### Binding sources
GET {{HrApi_HostAddress}}/api/minimal/employees/whoami?lang=ar
X-Client-Version: 2.4.1
